  "$semantic": "The names a screen uses. Dark is a lifted purple rather than a near black: the canvas sits at L 0.205 on the ink hue with a little chroma, so the product reads as itself at night instead of as a grey app, and nothing is so dark that a laptop at full brightness in a lit room becomes a mirror. Every pair is held to the thresholds in docs/design-system.md and checked by scripts/contrast.mjs.",
